OL,3,GNEWSAMajor route closed due to 'serious
OL,4,Aincident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major A-road is closed while
OL,7,Femergency services deal with what the
OL,8,FBBC understands is a serious incident.
OL,10,FRegent Street on the A420 in Kingswood,
OL,11,FBristol, has been shut by Avon and
OL,12,FSomerset Police, with the South Western
OL,13,FAmbulance Service also in attendance.
OL,15,FImages shared online show a cordon
OL,16,Foutside the Kings Chase Shopping
OL,17,FCentre.
OL,19,FIn a brief statement, a spokesperson
OL,20,Ffor the police said officers are at the
OL,21,Fscene and the road is closed in both
OL,22,Fdirections.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
